    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enotore Yakobo Esau",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neraposhu Yakobo inkonyek enyena aing'orisho, ng'ura, elotu Esau nerikito iltung'ana iip ong'uan. Metaa etooro inkera aoriki Lea o Raheli o nkaisiaayiak enyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepik inkaisiaayiak tenebo inkera enye dukuya, ore Lea o nkera enyena, o Raheli o Yosef nepuonu te siadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore ninye makewan neituruk te dukuya ninche, neirrugo abaiki enkop katitin naapishana, o metaba anaa nenyiku olalashe lenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ekuetua Esau alo anang'are ninye, neng'utut ninye, nebatatakino emurt enye ang'utut, neishir pokira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie eraposhu Esau nkonyek enyena, etodua inkituaak o nkera, nejo ninye, “Kakua kuna nikiboitare?” Nejo Yakobo, “Inkera naaishoo Enkai to lng'ur osinka lino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki nena aisiaayiak aanyiku, ninche tenebo inkera enye, neirrugo aabaiki enkop; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neitoki Lea tenebo inkera enyena aabau aanyiku neirrugo aabaiki enkop; ore te bayie e pooki nenyiku Yosef o Raheli, neirrugokino aabaiki enkop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Esau, “Ainyoo eutu ele orora pooki lainepua?” Newal Yakobo ajo, “Pee atum omom te dukuya nkonyek olkitok lai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etejo Esau, “Ekaata inaabaiki, olalashe lai; intaa pooki niata ininono.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Yakobo, “A'a, aatasayia, tenaa kanoto omom too nkonyek inono, neaku tang'amai naa enkishoroto ai too nkaik aainei; amu esipa tenajo ore enduaata natoduaa enkomom ino netiu anaa enduaata natoduaa enkomom e Nkai amu te nyorrata natiu neijia kitang'amua nanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tang'amai, aatasayia ina kishoroto ai nikiyakaki iyie, amu aaing'urrie Enkai oleng, naa kaata sii inaabaiki.” Ina peyie earaki ninye meewa, neya ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Esau ajo, “Emaibung'a enkoitoi aapuo, naa kaituruk te dukuya iyie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etiaka Yakobo ninye, “Eyiolo olkitok lai ajo ore kuna ng'aturran naa kenana, naa nanu ogolie intare o nkishu tenebo ilasho lenye, naa te nerewi oleng enkolong nabo, naa keye imasaa pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inchoo olkitok lai egiroo osinka lenye, pee ariku ninche maakutiti te risioroto e lototo oo nkishu naatii dukuya nanu o te risioroto e lototo oo inkera, omatabau enetii olkitok lai te Seir.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku etejo Esau, “Inchooki maatung'ueiki embata oo ltung'ana laainei laata tene.” Kake etejo, “Meeta tipat ning'uarie. Ayieu ake duoo natum omom te dukuya enkomom ino olkitok lai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa etorrinye Esau ina olong alo Seir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eshomo Yakobo Sukot, neshetaki kewan enkaji neitayu ninye ilngoborri loo nkishu enyena, metaa keji enkarna e ine wueji Sukot! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu Yakobo te Seriani o metabaiki enkanasa naji Shekem, natii ina kop e Kanaan einguaa Padan-aram, neun ilngoborri te mbata enkanasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.24.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 24.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.4.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yhn 4.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neinyang'u too layiok le Hamor, aa papaai le Shekem too mpisai iip nabo e seshati enkop naa ninye etuunie ilngoborri lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neshetu teine olperere lo lasar nedung'oki enkarna ine ajo El-Elohe Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.33.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
